endue.docs: the HWP 5.0 reader in this folder

본 제품은 한글과컴퓨터의 글 문서 파일(.hwp) 공개 문서를 참고하여 개발하였습니다.
This product was developed with reference to Hancom's published document file format for Hangul
(.hwp) files: "한글 문서 파일 형식 5.0" (HWP Document File Formats 5.0), revision 1.3, 2018-11-08,
by Hancom Inc. Hancom's terms for that document ask that every product built from it carries the
sentence above in its interface, manual, help and source.

Where the published document and files written by Hangul differ, the reader follows the files:
LIST_HEADER is 8 bytes before a cell's properties, a paragraph head is 12 bytes, border lines are
written side by side (kind, width, colour), line kind 0 draws no line, the number shape of a
numbering level sits in bits 5-8 of its head, paragraph indents, spacing and fixed line heights are
stored at twice their HWPUNIT size, and an unused underline or strikeout has line shape 15.

No code from other HWP implementations was used or followed.
